{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am safe in Dresden, having arrived last evening after a pleasant stop in Töplitz. The journey was swift, and the weather kind enough to spare us the worst of the autumn chill.\n\nI dropped into Tiek’s for a moment of respite and found Professor Hinrichs, who is now bound for Halle. We exchanged pleasantries over wine, his departure a small loss to the academic circle. I also sat with a gentleman who spoke with great vehemence about poetry and history. I had no idea who he was until he departed, at which point I realized it was Friedrich von Schlegel. He is a man of considerable energy, though his views seem to wander far from the solid ground of systematic thought. I suspect he has not yet settled his mind, but I found the conversation stimulating enough to wake me from the travel fatigue.\n\nI shall rest now. Do not worry; I am well, and I miss you and the boys terribly.\n\nYour devoted\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219077,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":215,"prompt_tokens":927,"total_tokens":1142,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-cruaRyJK4CmuU5MVB0qKUojz6KGn4pjb","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":927,"prompt_ms":1077.627,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1624886731391586,"prompt_per_second":860.2234353816302,"predicted_n":215,"predicted_ms":5073.357,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.70727570093458,"predicted_per_second":42.18114357022382}}